3s","timestamp":"19:53"},{"heroId":"jeff-the-land-shark","displayName":"Jeff the Land Shark","role":"Strategist","archetype":"Main Healer","lowRanks":"44–49%","grandmaster":"49%","celestial":"46%","trend":"Volatile","takeaway":"Ultimate value and general decision quality vary enough to keep his results middling.","imageUrl":"/images/heroes/jeff-the-land-shark.png","videoUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=VB6OIA-ChmA&t=1244s","timestamp":"20:44"},{"heroId":"gambit","displayName":"Gambit","role":"Strategist","archetype":"Tempo Support","lowRanks":"45–48%","grandmaster":"51%","celestial":"57%","trend":"Climbing","takeaway":"One of the largest climbs: synchronized teams turn his ultimate into a powerful push window.","imageUrl":"/images/heroes/gambit.png","videoUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=VB6OIA-ChmA&t=1281s","timestamp":"21:21"},{"heroId":"jubilee","displayName":"Jubilee","role":"Strategist","archetype":"Brawl Tempo Healer","lowRanks":"45–47%","grandmaster":"45–47%","celestial":"45–47%","trend":"Stable","takeaway":"A week-one baseline for a brand-new hero; players were still learning the kit and visual language.","imageUrl":"/images/heroes/jubilee.png","videoUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=VB6OIA-ChmA&t=1365s","timestamp":"22:45"},{"heroId":"luna-snow","displayName":"Luna Snow","role":"Strategist","archetype":"Main Healer","lowRanks":"45–47%","grandmaster":"47%","celestial":"46%","trend":"Stable","takeaway":"Self-cleanse remains valuable, but she was neither the answer nor a disaster at any measured rank.","imageUrl":"/images/heroes/luna-snow.png","videoUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=VB6OIA-ChmA&t=1415s","timestamp":"23:35"},{"heroId":"deadpool","displayName":"Healpool","role":"Strategist","archetype":"Flexible Healer","lowRanks":"Mid-40s","grandmaster":"Not stated","celestial":"41%","trend":"Falling","takeaway":"A deep kit cannot compensate for poor uptime; staying alive is the first requirement.","imageUrl":"/images/heroes/deadpool.png","videoUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=VB6OIA-ChmA&t=1446s","timestamp":"24:06"},{"heroId":"storm","displayName":"Storm","role":"Duelist","archetype":"Flyer","lowRanks":"56–58%","grandmaster":"55%","celestial":"54%","trend":"Falling","takeaway":"Still strong everywhere, with especially easy value when lower-rank players fail to contest aerial angles.","imageUrl":"/images/heroes/storm.png","videoUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=VB6OIA-ChmA&t=1477s","timestamp":"24:37"},{"heroId":"magik","displayName":"Magik","role":"Duelist","archetype":"Flexible DPS","lowRanks":"54–58%","grandmaster":"55%","celestial":"57%","trend":"Stable","takeaway":"The most consistent DPS and a strong one-trick because she can alternate between brawl and dive.","imageUrl":"/images/heroes/magik.png","videoUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=VB6OIA-ChmA&t=1509s","timestamp":"25:09"},{"heroId":"iron-man","displayName":"Iron Man","role":"Duelist","archetype":"Flyer","lowRanks":"52–56%","grandmaster":"54%","celestial":"44%","trend":"Falling","takeaway":"Strong until a dramatic Celestial cliff, where coordinated teams can focus a flyer quickly.","imageUrl":"/images/heroes/iron-man.png","videoUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=VB6OIA-ChmA&t=1565s","timestamp":"26:05"},{"heroId":"psylocke","displayName":"Psylocke","role":"Duelist","archetype":"Flanker","lowRanks":"51–56%","grandmaster":"57%","celestial":"54%","trend":"Climbing","takeaway":"A pure flanker whose poke, ultimate economy, and timing peak around Grandmaster.","imageUrl":"/images/heroes/psylocke.png","videoUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=VB6OIA-ChmA&t=1653s","timestamp":"27:33"},{"heroId":"mister-fantastic","displayName":"Mister Fantastic","role":"Duelist","archetype":"Brawler","lowRanks":"51–57%","grandmaster":"49%","celestial":"54%","trend":"Volatile","takeaway":"A brawler with a jagged curve whose results depend heavily on the lobby and team follow-up.","imageUrl":"/images/heroes/mister-fantastic.png","videoUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=VB6OIA-ChmA&t=1705s","timestamp":"28:25"},{"heroId":"daredevil","displayName":"Daredevil","role":"Duelist","archetype":"Dive DPS","lowRanks":"50–54%","grandmaster":"Not stated","celestial":"57%","trend":"Climbing","takeaway":"Pure dive rewards mechanics and timing, creating a clear rise as pilots improve.","imageUrl":"/images/heroes/daredevil.png","videoUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=VB6OIA-ChmA&t=1762s","timestamp":"29:22"},{"heroId":"black-cat","displayName":"Black Cat","role":"Duelist","archetype":"Flanker","lowRanks":"49–55%","grandmaster":"56%","celestial":"59%","trend":"Climbing","takeaway":"One of the biggest skill curves in the game and a top-end assassin when target choices are precise.","imageUrl":"/images/heroes/black-cat.png","videoUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=VB6OIA-ChmA&t=1801s","timestamp":"30:01"},{"heroId":"iron-fist","displayName":"Iron Fist","role":"Duelist","archetype":"Brawler","lowRanks":"51–54%","grandmaster":"51%","celestial":"52%","trend":"Stable","takeaway":"A steady brawler with no dramatic rank-specific failure or spike.","imageUrl":"/images/heroes/iron-fist.png","videoUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=VB6OIA-ChmA&t=1844s","timestamp":"30:44"},{"heroId":"hela","displayName":"Hela","role":"Duelist","archetype":"Hitscan","lowRanks":"≈50%","grandmaster":"52%","celestial":"54%","trend":"Climbing","takeaway":"Precision and positioning give this hitscan pick a modest upward curve.","imageUrl":"/images/heroes/hela.png","videoUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=VB6OIA-ChmA&t=1888s","timestamp":"31:28"},{"heroId":"black-panther","displayName":"Black Panther","role":"Duelist","archetype":"Dive DPS","lowRanks":"51–56%","grandmaster":"50%","celestial":"46%","trend":"Falling","takeaway":"Dominates teams that cannot track his path, then drops once coordinated opponents punish the dive.","imageUrl":"/images/heroes/black-panther.png","videoUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=VB6OIA-ChmA&t=1932s","timestamp":"32:12"},{"heroId":"human-torch","displayName":"Human Torch","role":"Duelist","archetype":"Flyer","lowRanks":"50–55%","grandmaster":"53%","celestial":"56%","trend":"Climbing","takeaway":"A sleeper flyer whose area pressure improves as players and teammates use it more purposefully.","imageUrl":"/images/heroes/human-torch.png","videoUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=VB6OIA-ChmA&t=1984s","timestamp":"33:04"},{"heroId":"blade","displayName":"Blade","role":"Duelist","archetype":"Brawler","lowRanks":"Mid-50s","grandmaster":"49%","celestial":"46%","trend":"Falling","takeaway":"Punishes isolated low-rank targets but struggles when teams deny his close-range approach.","imageUrl":"/images/heroes/blade.png","videoUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=VB6OIA-ChmA&t=2022s","timestamp":"33:42"},{"heroId":"spider-man","displayName":"Spider-Man","role":"Duelist","archetype":"Dive DPS","lowRanks":"48–52%","grandmaster":"50%","celestial":"51%","trend":"Stable","takeaway":"A surprisingly ordinary curve, possibly because stronger supports and other dive choices limit his payoff.","imageUrl":"/images/heroes/spider-man.png","videoUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=VB6OIA-ChmA&t=2072s","timestamp":"34:32"},{"heroId":"star-lord","displayName":"Star-Lord","role":"Duelist","archetype":"Flanker","lowRanks":"46–50%","grandmaster":"51%","celestial":"53%","trend":"Climbing","takeaway":"Peripheral poke, distraction, and ultimate value improve as lobbies create better openings.","imageUrl":"/images/heroes/star-lord.png","videoUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=VB6OIA-ChmA&t=2113s","timestamp":"35:13"},{"heroId":"winter-soldier","displayName":"Winter Soldier","role":"Duelist","archetype":"Poke DPS","lowRanks":"48–51%","grandmaster":"47%","celestial":"44%","trend":"Falling","takeaway":"Limited mobility makes every positioning error easier to isolate and punish at high rank.","imageUrl":"/images/heroes/winter-soldier.png","videoUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=VB6OIA-ChmA&t=2143s","timestamp":"35:43"},{"heroId":"hawkeye","displayName":"Hawkeye","role":"Duelist","archetype":"Poke DPS","lowRanks":"47–52%","grandmaster":"51%","celestial":"48%","trend":"Volatile","takeaway":"A mechanically gated poke specialist whose strongest pilots remain outliers and whose weaknesses are targetable.","imageUrl":"/images/heroes/hawkeye.png","videoUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=VB6OIA-ChmA&t=2186s","timestamp":"36:26"},{"heroId":"elsa-bloodstone","displayName":"Elsa Bloodstone","role":"Duelist","archetype":"Flexible DPS","lowRanks":"47–51%","grandmaster":"50%","celestial":"50%","trend":"Stable","takeaway":"A flexible utility DPS who peels, zones, and answers dives without specializing enough to spike.","imageUrl":"/images/heroes/elsa-bloodstone.png","videoUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=VB6OIA-ChmA&t=2236s","timestamp":"37:16"},{"heroId":"namor","displayName":"Namor","role":"Duelist","archetype":"Zone DPS","lowRanks":"48–50%","grandmaster":"47%","celestial":"43%","trend":"Falling","takeaway":"Deployable zoning loses value when higher-rank teams simply clear the squids.","imageUrl":"/images/heroes/namor.png","videoUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=VB6OIA-ChmA&t=2274s","timestamp":"37:54"},{"heroId":"the-punisher","displayName":"The Punisher","role":"Duelist","archetype":"Poke DPS","lowRanks":"≈48%","grandmaster":"≈48%","celestial":"≈48%","trend":"Stable","takeaway":"Straightforward angle-holding and sustained damage make him reliable but replaceable.","imageUrl":"/images/heroes/the-punisher.png","videoUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=VB6OIA-ChmA&t=2325s","timestamp":"38:45"},{"heroId":"wolverine","displayName":"Wolverine","role":"Duelist","archetype":"Tank Buster","lowRanks":"Low-to-high 40s","grandmaster":"46%","celestial":"49%","trend":"Climbing","takeaway":"A situational tank buster who needs tanks to hunt, team follow-up, and focused healing during the commit.","imageUrl":"/images/heroes/wolverine.png","videoUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=VB6OIA-ChmA&t=2372s","timestamp":"39:32"},{"heroId":"scarlet-witch","displayName":"Scarlet Witch","role":"Duelist","archetype":"Close-Range DPS","lowRanks":"45–47%","grandmaster":"40%","celestial":"37%","trend":"Falling","takeaway":"Forgiving tracking damage stops carrying once opponents punish her limited play patterns and telegraphed ultimate.","imageUrl":"/images/heroes/scarlet-witch.png","videoUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=VB6OIA-ChmA&t=2422s","timestamp":"40:22"},{"heroId":"deadpool","displayName":"DPSpool","role":"Duelist","archetype":"Flexible DPS","lowRanks":"43–46%","grandmaster":"47%","celestial":"45%","trend":"Stable","takeaway":"Staying alive, choosing upgrades deliberately, and using the ultimate purposefully remain the core requirements.","imageUrl":"/images/heroes/deadpool.png","videoUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=VB6OIA-ChmA&t=2472s","timestamp":"41:12"},{"heroId":"black-widow","displayName":"Black Widow","role":"Duelist","archetype":"Poke DPS","lowRanks":"43–45%","grandmaster":"45%","celestial":"48%","trend":"Climbing","takeaway":"The rework shows early promise, with her ranged threat becoming more credible as skill rises.","imageUrl":"/images/heroes/black-widow.png","videoUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=VB6OIA-ChmA&t=2504s","timestamp":"41:44"},{"heroId":"squirrel-girl","displayName":"Squirrel Girl","role":"Duelist","archetype":"Zone DPS","lowRanks":"Mid-40s","grandmaster":"38%","celestial":"31%","trend":"Falling","takeaway":"The roster’s worst top-end number: clever zoning remains possible, but coordinated dives shut her down.","imageUrl":"/images/heroes/squirrel-girl.png","videoUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=VB6OIA-ChmA&t=2564s","timestamp":"42:44"},{"heroId":"cyclops","displayName":"Cyclops","role":"Duelist","archetype":"Hitscan","lowRanks":"43–45%","grandmaster":"42%","celestial":"43%","trend":"Stable","takeaway":"A seemingly strong new hero whose week-one players had not yet converted kit power into wins.","im