      "summary": "As the Hood, Parker Robbins is treading the dangerous path toward the throne of the criminal underworld. Cloaked in a cursed mantle, he devours the firepower of his foes, feeding his own dark might. When he transforms into his full demonic state, a torrent of dark magic sweeps over all who stand in his way!",
